# CVEs baked into the ocis-groupware binary (Go modules) or its embedded web
# bundle. Unfixable by this repo - requires an upstream owncloud/ocis-groupware
# fix. Add an entry only when upstream cannot ship a fix promptly, and always
# with a justification comment: the CVE, why it is accepted, and the upstream
# issue tracking it. Remove the entry once the fix is released.
#
# Go `stdlib` findings are not upstream's problem: they mean the pinned
# golang builder digest in Dockerfile.multiarch is stale. Bump the digest
# instead of adding an entry here.
